### A. GET seluruh menu
GET http://localhost:3000/menus
Accept: application/json

### B. GET detail menu (ID 1)
GET http://localhost:3000/menus/1
Accept: application/json

### C. POST tambah menu baru
# @name createMenu
POST http://localhost:3000/menus
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Chicken Katsu Don",
  "description": "Japanese rice bowl with crispy chicken katsu",
  "price": 42000,
  "category": "Donburi",
  "isAvailable": true
}

### D. PATCH ubah menu (gunakan ID hasil POST di atas, default 5 pada server baru)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/menus/5
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 45000,
  "isAvailable": false
}

### E. DELETE menu (gunakan ID hasil POST di atas, default 5 pada server baru)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/menus/5

### F. Uji NotFoundException (404)
GET http://localhost:3000/menus/999
Accept: application/json

### G. Uji ConflictException (409 - nama menu duplikat)
POST http://localhost:3000/menus
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Signature Tonkotsu Ramen",
  "description": "Duplicate menu test with a valid description",
  "price": 45000,
  "category": "Ramen",
  "isAvailable": true
}

### H. Uji validasi DTO (400 - input tidak valid)
POST http://localhost:3000/menus
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "A",
  "description": "Short",
  "price": 500,
  "category": "Unknown"
}
